{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 1,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 558.59,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.059,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass that in the first year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 7.239,
      "end": 9.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from this time forward,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 9.184,
      "end": 14.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "king Mosiah having gone the way of all the earth, having warred a good warfare,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 14.472,
      "end": 18.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "walking uprightly before God, leaving none to reign in his stead;",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 18.971,
      "end": 21.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless he had established laws,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 21.659,
      "end": 23.888,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were acknowledged by the people;",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 24.068,
      "end": 27.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they were obliged to abide by the laws which he had made.",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 28.603,
      "end": 33.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that in the first year of the reign of Alma in the judgment-seat,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 34.077,
      "end": 36.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there was a man brought before him to be judged,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 37.09,
      "end": 38.715,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a man who was large,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 38.895,
      "end": 41.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and was noted for his much strength.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 41.943,
      "end": 48.863,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he had gone about among the people, preaching to them that which he termed to be the word of God,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 49.043,
      "end": 51.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "bearing down against the church;",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 51.406,
      "end": 56.329,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "declaring unto the people that every priest and teacher ought to become popular;",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 56.509,
      "end": 59.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they ought not to labor with their hands,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 59.429,
      "end": 62.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that they ought to be supported by the people.",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 63.035,
      "end": 68.143,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also testified unto the people that all mankind should be saved at the last day,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 68.323,
      "end": 70.784,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that they need not fear nor tremble,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 70.964,
      "end": 74.308,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that they might lift up their heads and rejoice;",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 74.488,
      "end": 76.764,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord had created all men,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 76.944,
      "end": 79.266,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had also redeemed all men;",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 79.446,
      "end": 82.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and, in the end, all men should have eternal life.",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 83.237,
      "end": 86.952,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he did teach these things",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 87.132,
      "end": 89.872,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so much that many did believe on his words,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 90.052,
      "end": 93.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so many that they began to support him and give him money.",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 94.54,
      "end": 97.837,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he began to be lifted up in the pride of his heart,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 98.017,
      "end": 100.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to wear very costly apparel,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 100.658,
      "end": 105.581,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and even began to establish a church after the manner of his preaching.",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 106.261,
      "end": 114.481,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass as he was going, to preach to those who believed on his word, he met a man who belonged to the church of God,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 114.661,
      "end": 116.797,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even one of their teachers;",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 116.977,
      "end": 119.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he began to contend with him sharply,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 119.758,
      "end": 123.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might lead away the people of the church;",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 123.282,
      "end": 127.322,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the man withstood him, admonishing him with the words of God.",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 128.002,
      "end": 130.231,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the name of the man was Gideon;",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 130.411,
      "end": 137.191,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it was he who was an instrument in the hands of God in delivering the people of Limhi out of bondage.",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 137.871,
      "end": 141.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, because Gideon withstood him with the words of God",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 141.395,
      "end": 143.299,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he was wroth with Gideon,",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 143.479,
      "end": 146.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and drew his sword and began to smite him.",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 146.306,
      "end": 148.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Gideon being stricken with many years,",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 149.133,
      "end": 152.337,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he was not able to withstand his blows,",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 152.517,
      "end": 154.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he was slain by the sword.",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 155.612,
      "end": 159.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the man who slew him was taken by the people of the church,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 159.647,
      "end": 164.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and was brought before Alma, to be judged according to the crimes which he had committed.",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 165.482,
      "end": 170.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he stood before Alma and pled for himself with much boldness.",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 171.085,
      "end": 172.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But Alma said unto him:",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 172.844,
      "end": 177.349,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, this is the first time that priestcraft has been introduced among this people.",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 177.529,
      "end": 180.826,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, thou art not only guilty of priestcraft,",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 181.006,
      "end": 183.746,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but hast endeavored to enforce it by the sword;",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 183.926,
      "end": 187.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were priestcraft to be enforced among this people",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 187.31,
      "end": 189.911,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it would prove their entire destruction.",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 190.591,
      "end": 193.61,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thou hast shed the blood of a righteous man,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 193.79,
      "end": 196.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, a man who has done much good among this people;",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 196.756,
      "end": 198.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were we to spare thee",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 198.84,
      "end": 201.348,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "his blood would come upon us for vengeance.",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 202.028,
      "end": 208.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore thou art condemned to die, according to the law which has been given us by Mosiah, our last king;",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 208.849,
      "end": 211.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it has been acknowledged by this people;",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 211.63,
      "end": 214.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore this people must abide by the law.",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 215.096,
      "end": 217.604,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they took him;",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 217.784,
      "end": 219.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his name was Nehor;",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 219.543,
      "end": 222.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they carried him upon the top of the hill Manti,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 222.788,
      "end": 228.5,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there he was caused, or rather did acknowledge, between the heavens and the earth,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 228.68,
      "end": 233.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that what he had taught to the people was contrary to the word of God;",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 234.061,
      "end": 236.569,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there he suffered an ignominious death.",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 237.249,
      "end": 242.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, this did not put an end to the spreading of priestcraft through the land;",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 242.63,
      "end": 246.252,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there were many who loved the vain things of the world,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 246.432,
      "end": 249.729,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they went forth preaching false doctrines;",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 249.909,
      "end": 253.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this they did for the sake of riches and honor.",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 253.747,
      "end": 256.023,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, they durst not lie,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 256.203,
      "end": 257.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it were known,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 257.73,
      "end": 259.402,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for fear of the law,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 259.582,
      "end": 261.254,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for liars were punished;",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 261.434,
      "end": 265.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they pretended to preach according to their belief;",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 265.608,
      "end": 269.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and now the law could have no power on any man for his belief.",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 270.05,
      "end": 273.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they durst not steal, for fear of the law,",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 273.62,
      "end": 275.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for such were punished;",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 275.379,
      "end": 277.794,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither durst they rob, nor murder,",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 277.974,
      "end": 280.9,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he that murdered was punished unto death.",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 281.58,
      "end": 291.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But it came to pass that whosoever did not belong to the church of God began to persecute those that did belong to the church of God,",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 291.791,
      "end": 294.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had taken upon them the name of Christ.",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 295.118,
      "end": 297.068,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, they did persecute them,",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 297.248,
      "end": 299.849,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and afflict them with all manner of words,",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 300.029,
      "end": 302.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this because of their humility;",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 302.67,
      "end": 305.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they were not proud in their own eyes,",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 305.451,
      "end": 309.073,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because they did impart the word of God, one with another,",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 309.253,
      "end": 311.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "without money and without price.",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 312.348,
      "end": 315.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now there was a strict law among the people of the church,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 316.011,
      "end": 318.287,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there should not any man,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 318.467,
      "end": 320.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "belonging to the church,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 320.18,
      "end": 323.895,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "arise and persecute those that did not belong to the church,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 324.075,
      "end": 327.094,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that there should be no persecution among themselves.",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 327.774,
      "end": 332.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, there were many among them who began to be proud,",
      "verse": "1:22",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 332.226,
      "end": 337.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to contend warmly with their adversaries, even unto blows;",
      "verse": "1:22",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 337.422,
      "end": 340.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they would smite one another with their fists.",
      "verse": "1:22",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 341.353,
      "end": 344.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this was in the second year of the reign of Alma,",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 344.644,
      "end": 347.988,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it was a cause of much affliction to the church;",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 348.168,
      "end": 351.465,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, it was the cause of much trial with the church.",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 352.145,
      "end": 354.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the hearts of many were hardened,",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 354.972,
      "end": 357.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their names were blotted out,",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 357.288,
      "end": 360.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they were remembered no more among the people of God.",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 360.533,
      "end": 363.552,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also many withdrew themselves from among them.",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 364.232,
      "end": 368.412,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this was a great trial to those that did stand fast in the faith;",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 368.592,
      "end": 373.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, they were steadfast and immovable in keeping the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 373.555,
      "end": 377.688,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they bore with patience the persecution which was heaped upon them.",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 378.368,
      "end": 383.337,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when the priests left their labor to impart the word of God unto the people,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 383.517,
      "end": 387.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the people also left their labors to hear the word of God.",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 387.319,
      "end": 390.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when the priest had imparted unto them the word of God",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 390.936,
      "end": 394.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they all returned again diligently unto their labors;",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 394.553,
      "end": 398.268,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the priest, not esteeming himself above his hearers,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 398.448,
      "end": 401.188,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the preacher was no better than the hearer,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 401.368,
      "end": 404.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither was the teacher any better than the learner;",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 405.124,
      "end": 406.935,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they were all equal,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 407.115,
      "end": 408.833,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did all labor,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 409.013,
      "end": 411.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every man according to his strength.",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 412.015,
      "end": 414.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did impart of their substance,",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 414.703,
      "end": 417.211,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every man according to that which he had,",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 417.391,
      "end": 419.62,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the poor, and the needy,",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 419.8,
      "end": 421.89,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the sick, and the afflicted;",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 422.07,
      "end": 424.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did not wear costly apparel,",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 424.618,
      "end": 426.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet they were neat and comely.",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 427.156,
      "end": 430.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus they did establish the affairs of the church;",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 430.819,
      "end": 433.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they began to have continual peace again,",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 433.971,
      "end": 436.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "notwithstanding all their persecutions.",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 437.019,
      "end": 439.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, because of the steadiness of the church",
      "verse": "1:29",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 439.985,
      "end": 446.951,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they began to be exceedingly rich, having abundance of all things whatsoever they stood in need\u2014",
      "verse": "1:29",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 447.131,
      "end": 449.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "an abundance of flocks and herds,",
      "verse": "1:29",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 449.679,
      "end": 451.583,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and fatlings of every kind,",
      "verse": "1:29",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 451.763,
      "end": 457.661,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also abundance of grain, and of gold, and of silver, and of precious things,",
      "verse": "1:29",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 457.841,
      "end": 460.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and abundance of silk and fine-twined linen,",
      "verse": "1:29",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 461.04,
      "end": 463.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all manner of good homely cloth.",
      "verse": "1:29",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 463.903,
      "end": 467.154,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus, in their prosperous circumstances,",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 467.334,
      "end": 470.213,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did not send away any who were naked,",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 470.393,
      "end": 473.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or that were hungry, or that were athirst,",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 473.267,
      "end": 476.518,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or that were sick, or that had not been nourished;",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 476.698,
      "end": 479.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did not set their hearts upon riches;",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 480.175,
      "end": 482.636,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they were liberal to all,",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 482.816,
      "end": 484.581,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both old and young,",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 484.761,
      "end": 486.526,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both bond and free,",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 486.706,
      "end": 488.378,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both male and female,",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 488.558,
      "end": 495.013,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whether out of the church or in the church, having no respect to persons as to those who stood in need.",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 495.693,
      "end": 497.318,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus they did prosper",
      "verse": "1:31",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 497.498,
      "end": 499.541,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and become far more wealthy",
      "verse": "1:31",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 499.721,
      "end": 502.6,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "than those who did not belong to their church.",
      "verse": "1:31",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 503.28,
      "end": 508.574,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For those who did not belong to their church did indulge themselves in sorceries,",
      "verse": "1:32",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 508.754,
      "end": 511.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in idolatry or idleness,",
      "verse": "1:32",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 511.535,
      "end": 512.975,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in babblings,",
      "verse": "1:32",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 513.155,
      "end": 515.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in envyings and strife;",
      "verse": "1:32",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 515.703,
      "end": 520.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wearing costly apparel; being lifted up in the pride of their own eyes;",
      "verse": "1:32",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 520.945,
      "end": 522.663,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "persecuting, lying,",
      "verse": "1:32",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 522.843,
      "end": 524.329,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thieving, robbing,",
      "verse": "1:32",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 524.509,
      "end": 526.785,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "committing whoredoms, and murdering,",
      "verse": "1:32",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 526.965,
      "end": 528.915,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all manner of wickedness;",
      "verse": "1:32",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 529.095,
      "end": 534.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, the law was put in force upon all those who did transgress it,",
      "verse": "1:32",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 534.43,
      "end": 536.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "inasmuch as it was possible.",
      "verse": "1:32",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 537.153,
      "end": 541.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that by thus exercising the law upon them,",
      "verse": "1:33",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 541.838,
      "end": 545.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every man suffering according to that which he had done,",
      "verse": "1:33",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 545.408,
      "end": 546.987,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they became more still,",
      "verse": "1:33",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 547.167,
      "end": 550.743,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and durst not commit any wickedness if it were known;",
      "verse": "1:33",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 550.923,
      "end": 557.935,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, there was much peace among the people of Nephi until the fifth year of the reign of the judges.",
      "verse": "1:33",
      "lineIndex": 163
    }
  ]
}